+# Build report — ui-design-pass phase 2 (Today screen)
+
+Source plan: `PRPs/plans/ui-design-pass-phase-2-today-screen.plan.md`
+(Task 11 — gates + budget probe; plan AC-A12, PRD AC-22).
+
+## Gates (Task 11 / Validation Level 1–2)
+
+All three green, no test weakened or skipped:
+
+- `npm run check` (`wrangler types --check && tsc -b && eslint . && prettier --check .`) — **PASS**
+- `npm test` (`vitest run`, both the `worker` and `docs` projects) — **PASS**, 13 test files / 289 tests, including the test pair's new `test/toast.test.ts` (22 cases, `src/shared/toast.ts`'s `reduceToast` / `autoDismisses`); every phase-1 suite (`test/format.test.ts`, `test/connectivity.test.ts`, `test/request-failure.test.ts`, `test/token-store.test.ts`, and the rest) stayed untouched and green.
+- `npm run build` (`tsc -b && vite build`, then the PWA service-worker inject pass) — **PASS**
+
+## `vite build` size table
+
+```
+dist/praesto/.dev.vars              0.15 kB
+dist/praesto/.vite/manifest.json    0.15 kB │ gzip:  0.11 kB
+dist/praesto/wrangler.json          1.53 kB │ gzip:  0.79 kB
+dist/praesto/index.js             216.97 kB │ gzip: 50.75 kB
+
+dist/client/.assetsignore                                 0.02 kB
+dist/client/index.html                                    3.96 kB │ gzip:  1.46 kB
+dist/client/assets/index-JBg_vZMF.css                    36.98 kB │ gzip:  7.40 kB
+dist/client/assets/workbox-window.prod.es5-Bd17z0YL.js    5.65 kB │ gzip:  2.20 kB
+dist/client/assets/index-BapuwNz7.js                    267.51 kB │ gzip: 86.28 kB
+
+dist/client/sw.mjs  17.37 kB │ gzip: 5.86 kB
+
+PWA v1.3.0
+mode      injectManifest
+format:   es
+precache  25 entries (395.82 KiB)
+files generated
+  dist/client/sw.js
+```
+
+Baseline before this phase (phase 1's report, build of the phase-1 branch on
+2026-08-21): JS 66,511 B gzip, CSS 6,882 B gzip. After this phase — the *Hoje*
+screen rebuilt into eleven new components, the module-level toast store, and
+the `useConnectivity` hook, all replacing the old inline-styled board — JS
+grows to 87,535 B gzip (+21,024 B, still 50% of budget) and CSS to 7,359 B
+gzip (+477 B, still 24% of budget). The `/design` route stays tree-shaken out
+of this bundle entirely (verified below); `TaskDetail.tsx` and `TokenGate.tsx`
+(moved verbatim, still inline-styled) contribute no new CSS.
+
+## §11 budget probe (Task 11 / Validation Level 3)
+
+```
+JS 87535 B gzip (budget 174080) · CSS 7359 B gzip (budget 30720)
+PASS: inside the §11 budget
+```
+
+Both figures are comfortably inside
+`documentation/40-engineering/ui-ux-guidelines.md` §11: JS at 50% of budget,
+CSS at 24%. Fonts and precache totals are unchanged from phase 1 (no font or
+asset added this phase).
+
+## Structural gate (Level 3)
+
+- No inline `style={}` object survives outside `DesignPlayground.tsx`,
+  `TaskDetail.tsx` and `TokenGate.tsx` (the two files Phase 3 rebuilds); no
+  `CSSProperties` import remains in `App.tsx`.
+- No `window.confirm` anywhere under `src/app` — `src/app/main.tsx`'s
+  `onNeedRefresh` now calls `showToast({ key: "sw-update", … })`.
+- No CSS `text-transform: uppercase` / `textTransform` anywhere under
+  `src/app/**/*.tsx` (guidelines §9.2).
+- `src/app/components/TaskRow.tsx` carries `[content-visibility:auto]`;
+  `src/app/styles.css` carries the `praesto-complete` / `praesto-leave`
+  keyframes anchored on `[data-shell]:has(…)`, not `:root`;
+  `src/app/components/TodayScreen.tsx` registers the `visibilitychange`
+  refetch that closes the roadmap's "refresh on foreground" backlog row.
+- `grep -rl 'tokens e estados' dist/client` finds nothing — the `/design`
+  playground (now carrying the new *Tela Hoje* section) is still absent from
+  the production bundle after the dynamic-import + `import.meta.env.DEV`
+  tree-shake.
+
+## Not part of this report
+
+The browser-pane Tier A / Tier B check of *Hoje* (guidelines checklist items
+1–9, the §8 states simulated, contrast at the row and deck surfaces, 375 px
+and 1280 px, keyboard/safe-area behaviour, screenshots or the written reason
+none exist) is performed by the main session after this Implementer run, per
+the plan's `## Notes` "Manual verification script" — not part of the
+Implementer's contract (Levels 1–3 only).
